    },
    "Exports cycling or running, supported recorded samples such as heart rate, power and speed, and route coordinates. Distance and energy use recorded totals without adding cumulative streams again; missing totals are not inferred. Apple Health calculates duration from start, end and pause events, which can differ from the recorded summary. Route accuracy is unknown and is not fabricated; altitude is omitted. Laps, running cadence, notes, tags, calculated summaries and other unsupported fields are omitted. This is a platform copy, not a complete backup. A new revision creates a new copy.": {
      "comment": "Application-owned iOS interface text. Keep identifiers, values and metric units unchanged.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Exports cycling or running, supported recorded samples such as heart rate, power and speed, and route coordinates. Distance and energy use recorded totals without adding cumulative streams again; missing totals are not inferred. Apple Health calculates duration from start, end and pause events, which can differ from the recorded summary. Route accuracy is unknown and is not fabricated; altitude is omitted. Laps, running cadence, notes, tags, calculated summaries and other unsupported fields are omitted. This is a platform copy, not a complete backup. A new revision creates a new copy."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "导出骑行/跑步、记录中的心率/功率/速度等支持的采样，以及路线经纬度。距离和能量使用记录总量，不重复叠加累计曲线；缺失总量不推算。Apple 健康会按起止时间和暂停事件计算时长，可能与记录摘要不同。路线精度未知，不伪造定位精度；海拔不写入。圈、跑步步频、备注、标签、后端计算摘要及其他不支持的字段不写入。这是平台副本，不是完整备份；新版本会生成新的副本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
